cmprovision4 (1.6.5~dev8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * /scriptexecute never answers with an error page; switch lookup
    failures and internal errors go to the web log.
  * Project activation (EEPROM image) shared by UI and API; settings
    normalised; firmware path allowlisted.
  * Settings: deleting a static IP updates dnsmasq.conf.
  * Images page tolerates missing files; local time display; [pi4] in
    config.txt; upload_tmp_dir on disk; production .env defaults.

